Step 1 — Create Process
Open UiPath Studio
Click New → Process
Enter name: SecureText
Click Create
Step 2 — Add Input Dialog
Go to Activities
Search Input Dialog
Drag Input Dialog into Main.xaml.

Set:

Title: Secure Text
Label: Enter Password
Input Type: Password

You will see an Output / Result field.

Click + → Create Variable and create:

password

Datatype should be:

String

So the password entered by the user will be stored in password.

Step 3 — Open Notepad
From Activities, search Use Application/Browser
Drag it below Input Dialog.
Click Indicate application to automate
Open Notepad.
Select the Notepad window.
Step 4 — Add Type Into

Inside Use Application/Browser:

Click Add Activity
Search Type Into
Select Type Into
Click inside the Notepad typing area.

In the Text field, enter:

password
